  "content": "<div>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/Faewulf-s-Lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faewulfs-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffaewulfslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> \n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2>📖 概述</h2>\n<p>另一個實用函數庫模組，提供了我在 (Faewulf) 的其他模組中常用的工具函數和方法。</p>\n<h2>⚠️ 必要模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric API（適用於 Fabric 載入器）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>💖 支援</h2>\n<p>如需支援、功能請求或錯誤回報，請前往該模組的 GitHub Issues 頁面，或加入我的 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></p>\n<h2>📜 授權條款</h2>\n<p>只要給予適當的署名，您可以在您的整合包中使用此模組。</p>",
